# The paper, its data artifacts and its standalone verification scripts now live
# in a separate repository (10-facets-6-d-polytopes-paper), so that the paper can
# be checked without reading or running this pipeline.  The three checks under
# paper/checks/ that import this pipeline ARE tracked here -- they cannot run
# standalone, and the paper cites them by that path.
paper/paper.tex
paper/references.bib
paper/make_tables.py
paper/tables/
paper/paper.pdf
paper/paper.bbl
README.md
REVIEW_NOTES.md
verify_polytope.py

# compiled artifacts of pipeline/c (sources are tracked, binaries are not)
pipeline/c/aak_parse
pipeline/c/stage2_filter
pipeline/c/libwildkernel.dylib

# Development scratch: exploratory scripts, logs, vendored third-party checkouts
# (CoxIter, HCPdm) and intermediate data.  Never an input to a published result.
scratchpad/
